\f0\b \cf0 Illusion of Life
\f1\b0  is a startup founded in early 2024 by animator 
\f0\b Pasquale D\'92Silva
\f1\b0  (\
@okpasquale\
) and AI developer 
\f0\b Kevin Fischer
\f1\b0  (\
@kevinafischer\
). The company draws its name from the classic Disney animation book 
\f2\i Disney Animation: The Illusion of Life
\f1\i0  by Frank Thomas and Ollie Johnston, which outlines principles for making animated characters feel alive and believable.\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 Mission and Focus\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 The company's mission is to bring animated characters to life using modern AI, blending traditional animation, puppetry, robotics, and AI agents. It aims to create empathetic, persistent digital (and physical) beings that interact warmly with humans\'97especially children and families\'97continuing the legacy of Walt Disney and Jim Henson by making characters feel real, teach kindness, and foster connection.\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 Key Product: Spark the Magic Dog\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 Their flagship character is 
\f0\b Spark
\f1\b0 , an animated blue dog enhanced by AI. Spark is "performed" live by professional puppeteers, with AI providing long-term memory, personality, and the ability to learn about users over time. The experience is delivered via the 
\f0\b Quantum Portal
\f1\b0 : a custom wooden case with a dedicated iPad shipped to subscribers' homes. Spark remembers family details, interests, and milestones, creating personalized, magical interactions.\
\pard\pardeftab560\sa40\partightenfactor0

