\f0\b\fs32 \cf0 Community and Events\
\pard\pardeftab560\slleading20\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs26 \cf0 The project has generated buzz in AI and crypto communities, including meme tokens inspired by Spark (though the company has distanced itself from unofficial ones). As of late 2025, they are inviting select families to experience Spark, with ongoing demos, vision documents shared publicly, and ties to events like the "Friend Walk" sponsored in the original context.\
For more, check their site: illusionoflife.inc or follow\
